        "draftId": "artifact-output-1-linkedin_post",
        "platform": "linkedin_post",
        "text": "Building Harmonia — our team of AI agents for startup content — killed my faith in safety theatre.\n\nWe ran our injection screen on 22 labelled texts.\n\nRules alone caught 7 of 12 hidden instructions. Better than nothing. Not shippable.\n\nThen we layered in Muse Glimmer, Meta's open-weight model running on a laptop, on top of the rules.\n\nResult: all 12 caught. None of the 10 clean texts wrongly flagged.\n\nThat move from 7/12 to 12/12 with zero false flags is what makes agent safety real for founders. You can demonstrate it, not just promise it.\n\nWe applied the same thinking to reliability. Every agent request now goes through a test that checks it against Meta's schema rules. That test caught a missing dependency that would have broken every tool-using agent on launch day.",
